graph-nl
    title Failure Recovery Flow - Sentinel

    Start([Worker Crash / Network Partition]) --> Detect[Orphaned Job Sweep / Timeout Detection]
    Detect --> CheckState{Job State?}
    CheckState -->|Stuck in RUNNING| TimeoutCheck{Exceeded Timeout?}
    TimeoutCheck -->|Yes| MarkFailed[Transition to FAILED / Retry]
    TimeoutCheck -->|No| Wait[Continue Waiting]
    CheckState -->|Stuck in QUEUED (Dispatch Failed)| Requeue[Re-trigger RQ Enqueue]
    Requeue --> End([System Restored])
    MarkFailed --> End
